  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><br>짝궁 선생님의 추진으로<br>음료수로만 만들어보는 밀도탑 실험을 해보았습니다<br><br><br>아이들에게<br>음료수를 준비해오라고 합니다<br>색깔있는 음료수를 준비해라고 이야기 해줍니다<br>이 때<br>파워에이드와 밀키스를 사올 친구들을 손들라고 이야기해서 지정해주고 <br>다른 친구들은 다른 색깔 음료수 사오라고 합니다.<br><br>안 사오면 못 마신다고 하니<br>각반에 1~3명정도 빼고 다 사옵니다<br>물론 각반 회장, 부회장한테 저녁때 쯤 반톡에 <br>음료 사오라고 안내하라고 해서 가능했는지 모릅니다<br>(안 사온 친구들에게는 새 종이컵을 줘서 마시게 합니다)<br><br>상상 이상의 음료도 사옵니다.<br>쌍화탕 가져온 친구도 있었습니다<br><br><br>실험 결과는<br>짜잔</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/24c4ba617a308c67d261c02bfd41e7d495158ffd\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/24c4ba617a308c67d261c02bfd41e7d495158ffd\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9a38ae750061fce4cad6d5eb9937b221c8df2f78\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9a38ae750061fce4cad6d5eb9937b221c8df2f78\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5edc0bb8dddaa63227bc4ae7395f0bf273ba2a60\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5edc0bb8dddaa63227bc4ae7395f0bf273ba2a60\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"1200\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">생각보다 잘 됩니다<br>뚜렷하게 경계선은 보이는 것은 아니나<br><br>위 사진에 나온<br>음료는 무엇일까요??<br><br>스크롤 내리시기 전<br>맞추어 보세요~~~<br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br><br></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e303c007af2743c137e8471b24690c09e6f927b7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e303c007af2743c137e8471b24690c09e6f927b7\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"675\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">위 음료입니다<br><br><br><br></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9172b5be7fc39b42769fbf796b75d942d15ae55c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9172b5be7fc39b42769fbf796b75d942d15ae55c\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\">이렇게 된 실험 조도 있고요<br><br><br></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/49cd8dad9068cee28b5870021d07076f74c88bb8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/49cd8dad9068cee28b5870021d07076f74c88bb8\" data-origin-width=\"3060\" data-origin-height=\"4080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a137c0e373b613afd5f4e9e9cd17535fc5cc9ccc\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a137c0e373b613afd5f4e9e9cd17535fc5cc9ccc\" data-origin-width=\"3060\" data-origin-height=\"4080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d4f1b74e206f9c9ca81572967207df35b31e6933\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d4f1b74e206f9c9ca81572967207df35b31e6933\" data-origin-width=\"3060\" data-origin-height=\"4080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/70996b3e35acac23cccecf2a5cdb9d6204fe2098\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/70996b3e35acac23cccecf2a5cdb9d6204fe2098\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e07e9163fd75e6785f43d47c9b5ba92fa7a7c2a3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e07e9163fd75e6785f43d47c9b5ba92fa7a7c2a3\" data-origin-width=\"1024\" data-origin-height=\"1365\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c480ff5833a2569fc48cb00ffe86c011398670f1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c480ff5833a2569fc48cb00ffe86c011398670f1\" data-origin-width=\"3060\" data-origin-height=\"4080\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size20\"><br>작품을 만들기 전<br>뭐를 먼저 넣어야 할지 테스트 해보고<br>작품을 만들라고 했습니다.<br><br><br>비커보다는 삼각플라스크<br>삼각플라스크보단 메스실린더가<br>밀도탑이 더 잘 만들어지는 느낌은<br>느낌일까요??<br><br><br><br><br></span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
